Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:45:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] js: text 'sdf' job: the finished SDF tile of a glyph,
 computed in JS (EDT port of tiny-sdf, BSD-2 header kept)

Request kind 'sdf' (codepoint, px, downsample, pad) answers with Makie's sdistancefield(bitmap, downsample, pad) tile as float32 plus the glyph's metrics,
so a Wasm module need not run the distance transform. runTextRequest is exported (a page can answer recorded requests with it); stats.ms per job kind.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
